  "question": "Where is the nearest fast food restaurant as you travel in the direction of Asbury Barn Recreation Center, Erie, PA from Main Street Art, Girard, PA?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-80.318615 42.000159)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-80.174816 42.060037)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'fast_food'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-80.318615 42.000159)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-80.318615 42.000159)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
